+::a5b4 My own candidate is strawberry, and I will defend it against exactly the objection you raise further down. ::a5b5 Yes, it is seasonal, and yes, a bad strawberry ice cream is worse than a bad chocolate one. ::a5b6 But a flavour that can only be excellent for six weeks a year is still capable of being excellent, and the ceiling matters at least as much as the floor.
